docs {
  # GET /course-announcement/{id}
  
  Retrieves announcements for a course.
  
  ## HTTP Method & Route
  - **Method:** `GET`
  - **Route:** `/wp-json/tutor/v1/course-announcement/:id`
  
  ## Authentication
  - **Requires** Bearer JWT (always authenticated).
  - User must be able to view the course.
  - Permission from the bound API key: `Read`, `Read/Write`, or `All`.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `id` | `integer` | **Yes** | Course post ID. |
  
  ## Responses
  
  ### 200 OK (Success)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_announcement",
    "message": "Announcement retrieved successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "ID": 401,
        "post_title": "Welcome to the Course & Live Q&A Session Schedule",
        "post_content": "We will be hosting a weekly live stream every Friday at 3 PM UTC.",
        "post_name": "welcome-live-qa-schedule"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ### 404 Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_announcement",
    "message": "Announcement not found for given ID",
    "data": {
      "status": 404
    }
  }
  ```
}
